<Base title="About" description="Proinn Consultancy, founded in 2015 by Tito Kishan Vemuri. The only Indian brand teaching TRIZ and DFP with MATRIZ, DFP-Institute and TRIZTI certifications.">
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>A school that turns engineers into inventors</h1>
      <p class="lede">Proinn Consultancy® started in 2015 with one intent: invention-driven innovation in Indian industry. We are the only Indian brand teaching TRIZ and DFP® with certifications from MATRIZ, DFP-Institute and TRIZTI®.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap two">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>What we believe</h2>
        <p>Problem solving leads to innovation. It is insane to expect a different result from the same action, and equally insane to expect a novel solution from modelling the problem the same way. We model every problem in five or more ways, so any problem can be solved with novelty.</p>
        <p>Subject matter expertise is necessary but not sufficient, or universities would file lakhs of patents. The other half is a method to invent. That is what we teach.</p>
        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Open and corporate certification workshops: TRIZ levels 1 to 3 and DFP levels 1 to 3.</li>
          <li>The-AIP™, the Accelerated Innovator Program: group mentoring on a real problem, four hours a weekend for six to eight weeks.</li>
          <li>Consultancy: innovation and IP strategy, differentiated solutions along RISIR® (reduce cost, increase performance, simplify, improve reliability, reduce environmental harm), and building an innovation culture with the Iccha Jnana Kriya Sakthi® framework.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Our purpose is to groom one million innovators and lift India into the top ten of the Global Innovation Index by 2047. Through TRIZTI, India's regional MATRIZ association, we teach Structured Jugaad® level 1 to engineering students for free, sponsored by every enrolment.</p>
      </div>
